            rent line, then it kills back abs(n) lines.

     kkiillll--ppaarraaggrraapphh
            Delete _n paragraphs starting with the current one.

     kkiillll--rreeggiioonn
            Kill the currently defined region.

     kkiillll--wwoorrdd
            Delete forward _n words.

     lleeaavvee--ttmmppddiirr--bbaacckkuuppss
