     ppuusshh--sshheellll
            Suspend mmgg and switch to alternate screen, if available.

     ppwwdd    Display current (global) working directory in the status area.

     qquueerryy--rreeppllaaccee
            Query Replace.  Search and replace strings selectively, prompting
            after each match.

     rreeppllaaccee--rreeggeexxpp
            Replace regular expression globally without individual prompting.

     rreeppllaaccee--ssttrriinngg
            Replace string globally without individual prompting.

     qquueerryy--rreeppllaaccee--rreeggeexxpp
