     ssccrroollll--uupp
            Scroll forward one page.  A two-line overlap between pages is as‐
            sumed.  If given a repeat argument, scrolls back lines, not pages.

     sseeaarrcchh--aaggaaiinn
            Search again, using the same search string and direction as the
