            (the last character that was matched).

     sseeaarrcchh--ffoorrwwaarrdd
            Search forward.  Get a search string from the user, and search for
            it starting at dot.  If found, dot gets moved to just after the
            matched characters, if not found, print a message.

     sseellff--iinnsseerrtt--ccoommmmaanndd
            Insert a character.

     sseenntteennccee--eenndd--ddoouubbllee--ssppaaccee
